{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "WHOOP",
  "description": {
    "en": "WHOOP recovery, strain, sleep and workouts in Gladys, with scenes and widgets.",
    "fr": "Récupération, effort, sommeil et entraînements WHOOP dans Gladys, avec scènes et widgets.",
    "de": "WHOOP-Erholung, Belastung, Schlaf und Trainings in Gladys, mit Szenen und Widgets.",
    "es": "Recuperación, esfuerzo, sueño y entrenamientos de WHOOP en Gladys, con escenas y widgets."
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/william-de71/gladys-whoop:0.1.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.3.0",
  "categories": ["leisure", "services"],
  "keywords": [
    "WHOOP 4.0",
    "WHOOP MG",
    "fitness tracker",
    "bracelet",
    "recovery",
    "récupération",
    "strain",
    "sommeil",
    "sleep tracker",
    "HRV"
  ],
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/William-De71/gladys-whoop/main/cover.jpg",
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "1. Your WHOOP app",
        "fr": "1. Votre application WHOOP",
        "de": "1. Deine WHOOP-App",
        "es": "1. Su aplicación WHOOP"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "WHOOP gives no shared key: sign in to developer-dashboard.whoop.com with your WHOOP account, create a team, then a free app with every read scope. As redirect URL, enter exactly https://my.gladysassistant.com/redirect/oauth. Then copy its Client ID and Client Secret below. Up to 10 members can connect to an app without any request to WHOOP.",
        "fr": "WHOOP ne fournit pas de clé partagée : connectez-vous à developer-dashboard.whoop.com avec votre compte WHOOP, créez une équipe, puis une application gratuite avec toutes les autorisations de lecture. Comme URL de redirection, saisissez exactement https://my.gladysassistant.com/redirect/oauth. Copiez ensuite son Client ID et son Client Secret ci-dessous. Jusqu’à 10 membres peuvent se connecter à une application sans rien demander à WHOOP.",
        "de": "WHOOP stellt keinen gemeinsamen Schlüssel bereit: Melde dich mit deinem WHOOP-Konto bei developer-dashboard.whoop.com an, erstelle ein Team und dann eine kostenlose App mit allen Lese-Berechtigungen. Als Redirect-URL gibst du genau https://my.gladysassistant.com/redirect/oauth ein. Kopiere dann Client ID und Client Secret hier unten. Bis zu 10 Mitglieder können sich ohne Antrag bei WHOOP mit einer App verbinden.",
        "es": "WHOOP no ofrece una clave compartida: inicie sesión en developer-dashboard.whoop.com con su cuenta WHOOP, cree un equipo y luego una aplicación gratuita con todos los permisos de lectura. Como URL de redirección, introduzca exactamente https://my.gladysassistant.com/redirect/oauth. Copie después su Client ID y su Client Secret abajo. Hasta 10 miembros pueden conectarse a una aplicación sin pedir nada a WHOOP."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://developer-dashboard.whoop.com",
          "label": {
            "en": "WHOOP developer dashboard",
            "fr": "Tableau de bord développeur WHOOP",
            "de": "WHOOP-Entwickler-Dashboard",
            "es": "Panel de desarrollador de WHOOP"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/William-De71/gladys-whoop/blob/main/docs/en.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Step-by-step guide",
            "fr": "Guide pas à pas",
            "de": "Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung",
            "es": "Guía paso a paso"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Client ID",
        "fr": "Client ID",
        "de": "Client ID",
        "es": "Client ID"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The Client ID of your WHOOP app.",
        "fr": "Le Client ID de votre application WHOOP.",
        "de": "Die Client ID deiner WHOOP-App.",
        "es": "El Client ID de su aplicación WHOOP."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "client_secret",
      "type": "secret",
      "required": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Client Secret",
        "fr": "Client Secret",
        "de": "Client Secret",
        "es": "Client Secret"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Kept in Gladys, never shown again nor logged.",
        "fr": "Conservé dans Gladys, plus jamais affiché ni journalisé.",
        "de": "Bleibt in Gladys, wird nie wieder angezeigt oder protokolliert.",
        "es": "Se guarda en Gladys, nunca se vuelve a mostrar ni se registra."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "connect_intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "2. Connect your WHOOP account",
        "fr": "2. Connectez votre compte WHOOP",
        "de": "2. Verbinde dein WHOOP-Konto",
        "es": "2. Conecte su cuenta WHOOP"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Save first, then click the button and accept every permission on WHOOP. The connection renews itself; connect again only if Gladys reports a refused access.",
        "fr": "Enregistrez d’abord, puis cliquez sur le bouton et acceptez toutes les autorisations sur WHOOP. La connexion se renouvelle seule ; reconnectez-vous seulement si Gladys signale un accès refusé.",
        "de": "Zuerst speichern, dann auf die Schaltfläche klicken und bei WHOOP alle Berechtigungen akzeptieren. Die Verbindung erneuert sich selbst; verbinde dich nur erneut, wenn Gladys einen abgelehnten Zugriff meldet.",
        "es": "Guarde primero, pulse el botón y acepte todos los permisos en WHOOP. La conexión se renueva sola; vuelva a conectarse solo si Gladys indica un acceso rechazado."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "whoop_account",
      "type": "oauth2",
      "label": {
        "en": "Connect with WHOOP",
        "fr": "Se connecter avec WHOOP",
        "de": "Mit WHOOP verbinden",
        "es": "Conectar con WHOOP"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Gladys only asks to read your data (recovery, cycles, sleep, workouts, profile, body measurement); it never changes anything in WHOOP.",
        "fr": "Gladys demande seulement à lire vos données (récupération, cycles, sommeil, entraînements, profil, mensurations) ; elle ne modifie rien dans WHOOP.",
        "de": "Gladys fragt nur Lesezugriff auf deine Daten an (Erholung, Zyklen, Schlaf, Trainings, Profil, Körpermaße) und ändert nichts bei WHOOP.",
        "es": "Gladys solo pide leer sus datos (recuperación, ciclos, sueño, entrenamientos, perfil, medidas corporales); nunca cambia nada en WHOOP."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "options_intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "3. Options",
        "fr": "3. Options",
        "de": "3. Optionen",
        "es": "3. Opciones"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "interval",
      "type": "select",
      "required": false,
      "default": "15",
      "label": {
        "en": "Reading interval",
        "fr": "Fréquence de lecture",
        "de": "Abfrageintervall",
        "es": "Intervalo de lectura"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often Gladys reads WHOOP (about four requests each time).",
        "fr": "À quelle fréquence Gladys lit WHOOP (environ quatre requêtes à chaque fois).",
        "de": "Wie oft Gladys WHOOP abfragt (jeweils etwa vier Anfragen).",
        "es": "Con qué frecuencia Gladys lee WHOOP (unas cuatro solicitudes cada vez)."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "15",
          "label": {
            "en": "Every 15 minutes",
            "fr": "Toutes les 15 minutes",
            "de": "Alle 15 Minuten",
            "es": "Cada 15 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "30",
          "label": {
            "en": "Every 30 minutes",
            "fr": "Toutes les 30 minutes",
            "de": "Alle 30 Minuten",
            "es": "Cada 30 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "60",
          "label": {
            "en": "Every hour",
            "fr": "Toutes les heures",
            "de": "Stündlich",
            "es": "Cada hora"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "language",
      "type": "select",
      "required": false,
      "default": "auto",
      "label": {
        "en": "Language of the texts",
        "fr": "Langue des textes",
        "de": "Sprache der Texte",
        "es": "Idioma de los textos"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "For the device name, the recovery zone and the scene summaries. Automatic follows the language of your dashboard.",
        "fr": "Pour le nom de l’appareil, la zone de récupération et les résumés des scènes. Automatique suit la langue de votre tableau de bord.",
        "de": "Für den Gerätenamen, die Erholungszone und die Szenen-Zusammenfassungen. Automatisch folgt der Sprache deines Dashboards.",
        "es": "Para el nombre del dispositivo, la zona de recuperación y los resúmenes de las escenas. Automático sigue el idioma de su panel."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "auto",
          "label": {
            "en": "Automatic",
            "fr": "Automatique",
            "de": "Automatisch",
            "es": "Automático"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "en",
          "label": {
            "en": "English",
            "fr": "Anglais",
            "de": "Englisch",
            "es": "Inglés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "fr",
          "label": {
            "en": "French",
            "fr": "Français",
            "de": "Französisch",
            "es": "Francés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "de",
          "label": {
            "en": "German",
            "fr": "Allemand",
            "de": "Deutsch",
            "es": "Alemán"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "es",
          "label": {
            "en": "Spanish",
            "fr": "Espagnol",
            "de": "Spanisch",
            "es": "Español"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "refresh",
      "timeout_seconds": 60,
      "label": {
        "en": "Sync now",
        "fr": "Synchroniser maintenant",
        "de": "Jetzt abrufen",
        "es": "Sincronizar ahora"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Reads WHOOP now instead of waiting for the next reading.",
        "fr": "Lit WHOOP tout de suite sans attendre la prochaine lecture.",
        "de": "Fragt WHOOP sofort ab, ohne auf die nächste Abfrage zu warten.",
        "es": "Lee WHOOP ahora sin esperar a la próxima lectura."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "diagnostic",
      "timeout_seconds": 15,
      "label": {
        "en": "Diagnostic",
        "fr": "Diagnostic",
        "de": "Diagnose",
        "es": "Diagnóstico"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Writes an anonymized summary to the logs of the integration, to attach to a bug report.",
        "fr": "Écrit un résumé anonymisé dans les journaux de l’intégration, à joindre à un rapport de bug.",
        "de": "Schreibt eine anonymisierte Zusammenfassung in die Protokolle der Integration, für einen Fehlerbericht.",
        "es": "Escribe un resumen anonimizado en los registros de la integración, para adjuntarlo a un informe de error."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "disconnect",
      "timeout_seconds": 30,
      "label": {
        "en": "Unlink the WHOOP account",
        "fr": "Délier le compte WHOOP",
        "de": "WHOOP-Konto trennen",
        "es": "Desvincular la cuenta WHOOP"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Revokes the access of your app to the account and forgets the tokens. The device stays, without new values.",
        "fr": "Révoque l’accès de votre application au compte et oublie les jetons. L’appareil reste, sans nouvelles valeurs.",
        "de": "Widerruft den Zugriff deiner App auf das Konto und vergisst die Tokens. Das Gerät bleibt, ohne neue Werte.",
        "es": "Revoca el acceso de su aplicación a la cuenta y olvida los tokens. El dispositivo se queda, sin valores nuevos."
      }
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "key": "today",
      "icon": "activity",
      "action_timeout_seconds": 60,
      "label": {
        "en": "WHOOP today",
        "fr": "WHOOP aujourd’hui",
        "de": "WHOOP heute",
        "es": "WHOOP hoy"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Recovery and its zone, today’s strain, HRV, resting heart rate and calories.",
        "fr": "Récupération et sa zone, effort du jour, VFC, fréquence au repos et calories.",
        "de": "Erholung und Zone, heutige Belastung, HRV, Ruhepuls und Kalorien.",
        "es": "Recuperación y su zona, esfuerzo del día, VFC, frecuencia en reposo y calorías."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "sleep",
      "icon": "moon",
      "label": {
        "en": "WHOOP sleep",
        "fr": "WHOOP sommeil",
        "de": "WHOOP Schlaf",
        "es": "WHOOP sueño"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The last sleep: performance, time asleep, stages, efficiency, sleep need.",
        "fr": "Le dernier sommeil : performance, durée, phases, efficacité, besoin de sommeil.",
        "de": "Der letzte Schlaf: Leistung, Dauer, Phasen, Effizienz, Schlafbedarf.",
        "es": "El último sueño: rendimiento, duración, fases, eficiencia, sueño necesario."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "workouts",
      "icon": "list",
      "label": {
        "en": "WHOOP workouts",
        "fr": "WHOOP entraînements",
        "de": "WHOOP Trainings",
        "es": "WHOOP entrenamientos"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The last workouts with their strain, and today’s strain.",
        "fr": "Les derniers entraînements avec leur effort, et l’effort du jour.",
        "de": "Die letzten Trainings mit ihrer Belastung und die heutige Belastung.",
        "es": "Los últimos entrenamientos con su esfuerzo, y el esfuerzo del día."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "week",
      "icon": "bar-chart-2",
      "label": {
        "en": "WHOOP 7 days",
        "fr": "WHOOP 7 jours",
        "de": "WHOOP 7 Tage",
        "es": "WHOOP 7 días"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The last seven days as bars: recovery, strain, sleep performance or HRV.",
        "fr": "Les sept derniers jours en barres : récupération, effort, sommeil ou VFC.",
        "de": "Die letzten sieben Tage als Balken: Erholung, Belastung, Schlafleistung oder HRV.",
        "es": "Los últimos siete días en barras: recuperación, esfuerzo, sueño o VFC."
      },
      "settings": [
        {
          "key": "metric",
          "type": "select",
          "required": false,
          "default": "recovery",
          "label": {
            "en": "Shown",
            "fr": "Affiché",
            "de": "Angezeigt",
            "es": "Mostrado"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "recovery",
              "label": {
                "en": "Recovery",
                "fr": "Récupération",
                "de": "Erholung",
                "es": "Recuperación"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "strain",
              "label": {
                "en": "Day strain",
                "fr": "Effort du jour",
                "de": "Tagesbelastung",
                "es": "Esfuerzo del día"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "sleep_performance",
              "label": {
                "en": "Sleep performance",
                "fr": "Performance du sommeil",
                "de": "Schlafleistung",
                "es": "Rendimiento del sueño"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "hrv",
              "label": {
                "en": "HRV",
                "fr": "VFC",
                "de": "HRV",
                "es": "VFC"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "recovery_scored",
      "label": {
        "en": "WHOOP: recovery scored",
        "fr": "WHOOP : récupération calculée",
        "de": "WHOOP: Erholung berechnet",
        "es": "WHOOP: recuperación calculada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "WHOOP scored a new recovery: the member woke up and the morning numbers are there. Seen at the next reading.",
        "fr": "WHOOP a calculé une nouvelle récupération : le membre s’est réveillé et les chiffres du matin sont là. Vu à la lecture suivante.",
        "de": "WHOOP hat eine neue Erholung berechnet: Das Mitglied ist aufgewacht und die Morgenwerte sind da. Bei der nächsten Abfrage erkannt.",
        "es": "WHOOP calculó una nueva recuperación: el miembro se ha despertado y los datos de la mañana están listos. Se detecta en la siguiente lectura."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "member",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "WHOOP member",
            "fr": "Membre WHOOP",
            "de": "WHOOP-Mitglied",
            "es": "Miembro WHOOP"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Leave empty for any member.",
            "fr": "Laissez vide pour tous les membres.",
            "de": "Leer lassen für jedes Mitglied.",
            "es": "Déjelo vacío para cualquier miembro."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "zone",
          "type": "multi_select",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Zone",
            "fr": "Zone",
            "de": "Zone",
            "es": "Zona"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Leave empty for any zone.",
            "fr": "Laissez vide pour toutes les zones.",
            "de": "Leer lassen für jede Zone.",
            "es": "Déjelo vacío para cualquier zona."
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "green",
              "label": {
                "en": "Green (67-100 %)",
                "fr": "Vert (67-100 %)",
                "de": "Grün (67-100 %)",
                "es": "Verde (67-100 %)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "yellow",
              "label": {
                "en": "Yellow (34-66 %)",
                "fr": "Jaune (34-66 %)",
                "de": "Gelb (34-66 %)",
                "es": "Amarillo (34-66 %)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "red",
              "label": {
                "en": "Red (0-33 %)",
                "fr": "Rouge (0-33 %)",
                "de": "Rot (0-33 %)",
                "es": "Rojo (0-33 %)"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "member",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Member device",
            "fr": "Appareil du membre",
            "de": "Gerät des Mitglieds",
            "es": "Dispositivo del miembro"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "member_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Member name",
            "fr": "Nom du membre",
            "de": "Name des Mitglieds",
            "es": "Nombre del miembro"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "recovery",
